ry must be connected to one or more fixed assets.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IntangibleAssets\">Intangible Assets</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-wind text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IntangibleAssets\">Intangible Assets</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization Assets Code Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets Is On To ToDate\">The <code>Intangible Assets</code> tab is designed to manage assets that do not have a physical form, such as patents or copyrights, including the process of their amortization.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AmortizationEntries\">Amortization Entries</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-sort-amount-down text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AmortizationEntries\">Amortization Entries</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntries Assets Code Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets Is On\">The <code>Amortization Entries</code> tab is designed for documenting the gradual expense recognition of intangible assets.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntry Assets Code Every Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets Is On Sent To ToDate\">If you utilize this tab, it's essential to use <code>Intangible Assets</code> too, since every amortization entry must be connected to one or several intangible assets.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">Capital Accounts</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-chart text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">Capital Accounts</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Balance Business CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Code Count Current CurrentBalance Investment Investments Is On Partners Rent To ToDate Withdrawal\">The <code>Capital Accounts</code> tab is designed to monitor the investments, withdrawals, and current balances of business owners or partners individually.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SpecialAccounts\">Special Accounts</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"f